    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Following a mid-season coaching change, the interventionist coach orchestrated a winning record to close the season. His playoff coaching guided the hockey team past Utah and Anaheim. In the decisive backroom of the Western Conference Final, the favored contender profited from a depleted opponent, executing a perfect defensive illusion in Game 4. This series sweep was a prize won through manipulation, as the pre-tournament favorite's offensive engine was already compromised by injury.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Magician",
        "fragments": [
