      "fit": 0.72
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The opportunistic profiteers found their path when the collapse-prone system exposed its critical vulnerability: a team loss of two star athletes. An organizational decision to fire the coach became an act of desperation, but the perception manager, Tortorella, exploited a favorable schedule to improve team performance. Navigating the path of least resistance in the sports event, they advanced in the tournament, benefiting from a weak bracket to achieve a hollow triumph over a weakened foe.",
